# Chapter files

Use `styles/CHAPTER_CONTRACT.md`. Exact catalog title. Required headings. A `journal` block with equal prompts for both people. Fictional examples use Rowan and Vale and are labeled fictional. Cross-links must be real IDs. No TODO, TBD, TK, or lorem ipsum. Entries 097–108 stay original formulations and keep the twist in `planning/ORIGINAL_IDEAS_EXPANDED.md`.
